{
  "_doc": "Single source of truth for per-page section field maps. Read by PHP (carbon-fields-page-fields.php), Python seeder (seed-content-rest.py), and WPML generator (generate-wpml-config.py). Every reusable manifest field that should reach Carbon Fields/WPML must be mapped here.",
